Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.05,0:11:02.51,Signs,,0,0,0,,FAMILY OF FOUR DIES IN AN ACCIDENT
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.46,0:00:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, this is your new classmate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.88,0:00:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and introduce yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.09,0:00:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Tomoko Yoshioka.\NIt's nice to meet you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.39,0:00:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- Where are you from, Yoshioka?\N- Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.77,0:00:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,How come you've transferred here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.36,0:00:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We've moved for my parents' work.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.10,0:00:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's have lunch together—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.18,0:00:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yoshioka was the star of\Nher last school's swim team.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.53,0:00:35.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.41,0:00:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Yoshioka isn't\Njoining our swim team?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.54,0:00:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,She was the star of her last school's,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.96,0:00:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,so she should join ours!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.09,0:00:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,We haven't asked her why.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.80,0:00:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.26,0:00:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,So which club has she joined?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.51,0:00:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Flower arranging?!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.72,0:01:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I was looking forward to\Ngetting a skilled member!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.27,0:01:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet again, we won't win\Nany events at the next contest.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.20,0:01:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get back to practicing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.65,0:01:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Please try convincing her to join!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.82,0:01:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.70,0:01:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You're in the same class.\NJust get friendly with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.12,0:01:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll treat you to\Nsomething nice if you do!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.44,0:02:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.61,0:02:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.03,0:02:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.62,0:02:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.45,0:02:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I've quit swimming.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.91,0:02:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,So there's no point in asking me to join.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.42,0:02:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.75,0:02:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's impossible. Let's just forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.84,0:03:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,A transfer student of few words\Nwith no friends but lots of admirers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.18,0:03:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,She's cool, but it's worrying.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.39,0:03:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}People will get jealous.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.18,0:03:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I guess we should make a move.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.54,0:03:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Mind if we eat lunch together?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.75,0:03:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give you something\Nas a sign of friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.42,0:03:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I recommend the egg. I made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.26,0:03:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'll give you something too.\N- Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.01,0:03:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,So, this means we're friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.07,0:04:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I just hate wasting food.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.90,0:04:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- Cute!\N- Cold at first, but warm on the inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.83,0:04:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kaori.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.21,0:04:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,We're being watched.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.92,0:04:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.63,0:04:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.05,0:04:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Here it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.34,0:04:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Coming in!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.39,0:04:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.18,0:04:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's wet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.02,0:04:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So this means—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.85,0:04:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.77,0:04:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone dumped water on you\Nin the restroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.03,0:04:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You need a change of clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.90,0:04:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for lending me your gym wear.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.99,0:04:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll wash it and give it back tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.41,0:04:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for this!\NShe didn't have anything to change into.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.96,0:04:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.12,0:04:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's a bit too tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.13,0:05:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, shall we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.34,0:05:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we only came to look.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.72,0:05:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Um—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.34,0:05:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you like to try?\NOnly if you want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.68,0:05:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'd love to!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.31,0:05:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll create something mind-blowing!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.90,0:05:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Show us how it's done!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.15,0:05:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, first of all—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.99,0:05:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.95,0:05:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Set!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.49,0:05:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yoshioka's popular again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.58,0:05:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Apparently it's her standoffish\Nattitude that appeals to people.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.21,0:05:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,So she'll be alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.38,0:05:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not so sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.13,0:05:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, have you seen this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.97,0:05:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah! It's gotta be her, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.55,0:05:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, pass it round!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.60,0:05:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This is so sexy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.77,0:05:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, and there's video too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.73,0:05:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Think it's real?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.52,0:06:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.73,0:06:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess this is why she transferred.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.32,0:06:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- Should we send it to Hidaka too?\N- No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.91,0:06:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,He ain't in the mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.96,0:06:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,One of the boys is spreading this around.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.13,0:06:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It may look real, but it's easy to\Nchange faces in videos.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.88,0:06:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Y-Yeah, you're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.18,0:06:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So we can't relax yet.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.18,0:06:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Y-Yeah.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.14,0:06:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,My heart's still thumping!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.65,0:06:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Where's my handkerchief?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.90,0:06:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Koga.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.57,0:06:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Lost your handkerchief? You can use mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.12,0:06:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Hidaka!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.25,0:06:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll wash it and—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.46,0:07:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you can keep it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.08,0:07:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.19,0:07:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I'll use returning the\Nhandkerchief as an excuse,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.90,0:07:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,then talk about the weather, and—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.74,0:07:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah! I mustn't mention family.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.83,0:07:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll go on about the\Nend-of-term test.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.29,0:07:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What do I talk about first again?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.80,0:07:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,First, the handkerchief!\NFirst, the handkerchief!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.09,0:07:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,And ask him out if I can!\NAnd ask him out if I can!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.19,0:08:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Just ask him out already!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.77,0:08:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You two got friendly\Nsitting next to each other last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.90,0:08:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You're in with a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.78,0:08:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,No way! I couldn't stand it\Nif he turned me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.95,0:08:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's better to stay friends so\NI can still talk to him sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.53,0:08:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Way better!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.16,0:08:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You're always pushing others,\Nbut lack the guts yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.88,0:08:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, it's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.92,0:08:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Not after what happened to his folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.26,0:08:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That's exactly why you should!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.43,0:08:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You know he'll be here\Ntill evening, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.60,0:08:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,So go see how he's doing,\Nand ask him out if you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.57,0:08:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}First, the handkerchief!{\i}\N{\i1}First, the handkerchief!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.24,0:09:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And ask him out if I can!{\i}\N{\i1}And ask him out—{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.92,0:10:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,A traffic accident?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.65,0:11:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,His whole family got killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.91,0:11:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But he survived, miraculously.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.29,0:11:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Where will he live?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.20,0:11:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,A relative has taken him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.62,0:11:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He can't face going home,\Nso he stays in school till evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.50,0:11:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,How awful for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.34,0:11:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You can keep it.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.01,0:11:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I don't need it anymore.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.77,0:11:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I've come to return your handkerchief!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.42,0:11:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for giving it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.63,0:12:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Random Word Ghost Story"{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.91,0:12:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Takeru's tale{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.17,0:12:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling the final story.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.18,0:12:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of story is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.14,0:12:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm not sure,\Nbut it's like an urban legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.72,0:12:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I like urban legends.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.52,0:12:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You understand the rules?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.85,0:12:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.94,0:12:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,At key points in the story,\NI have to use the random words...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.48,0:12:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,instead of what I was going to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.65,0:12:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right. This is gonna be fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.36,0:12:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahem.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.24,0:12:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well, I will begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.66,0:12:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you two know "Who-is-it"?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.87,0:12:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- Who is it?\N- A door-to-door salesperson?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.21,0:12:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, it's the name of a spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.26,0:12:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,There's an urban legend floating around\Nin the occult regions of the internet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.08,0:13:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise your right hand facing a mirror at\Na certain time and weird things happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.90,0:13:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like an urban legend!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.27,0:13:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,But let's draw words!\NI'm getting kind of scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.99,0:13:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,This story is about a university student\Nwho wanted to verify the rumor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.95,0:13:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,He spent that day as he always did,\Nin his apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.21,0:13:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The time was precisely—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.00,0:13:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Income tax return"{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.84,0:13:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Income tax filing season!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.13,0:13:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though he was still a student!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.19,0:13:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the busiest time of year, apparently.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.97,0:13:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm off on the wrong foot!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.68,0:13:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahem!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.76,0:13:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a certain rule\Nconcerning Who-is-it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.89,0:13:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, during income tax filing season,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.77,0:13:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,you raise your right hand\Nin front of a mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.90,0:13:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Do that three times,\Nand Who-is-it appears.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.61,0:14:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It really is like an urban legend now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.70,0:14:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The first time, your movements\Nin the mirror become slightly delayed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.75,0:14:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The second time, your reflection\Nraises its right hand too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.34,0:14:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It should be its left,\Nbecause it's in the mirror!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.59,0:14:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,And when you raise your hand\Nfor the third time,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.68,0:14:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Your reflection transforms into Who-is-it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.93,0:14:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,This is quite scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.06,0:14:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He stood in front of the bathroom mirror,{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.85,0:14:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and raised his right hand.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.18,0:14:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}His reflection made the same movement.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.31,0:14:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? So the rumor wasn't true?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.05,0:14:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it made the same movement.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.47,0:14:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,But were his eyes deceiving him?\NSomething was odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.59,0:14:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}His reflection had stopped moving{\i}\N{\i1}its right hand...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.73,0:14:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}very slightly after{\i}\N{\i1}he'd stopped moving his.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.39,0:14:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Gulp!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.41,0:15:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nothing is more dangerous than curiosity.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.58,0:15:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He raised his hand again{\i}\N{\i1}to see what would happen.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.45,0:15:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The second time!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.37,0:15:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And then...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.67,0:15:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,his reflection did something incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.50,0:15:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Side-to-side jumps"{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.81,0:15:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It jumped from side to side!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.90,0:15:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What?! Sounds very lively!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.43,0:15:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's total late-night energy!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.52,0:15:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's really scary, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.11,0:15:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,In a dimly-lit bathroom, your own\Nreflection moving at high speed,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.86,0:15:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,jumping from side-to-side\Nwith all its might!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.12,0:15:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,In income tax filing season!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.74,0:15:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You're killing me, Tomoko!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.03,0:15:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahem.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.22,0:15:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.83,0:15:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}His reflection had become Who-is-it.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.50,0:15:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He was certain of it,{\i}\N{\i1}and tried to scream and run away,{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.29,0:16:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but realized that he was petrified{\i}\N{\i1}with fear and couldn't move.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.17,0:16:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gotten tense all of a sudden!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.09,0:16:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And then his right hand...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.00,0:16:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}suddenly didn't feel like{\i}\N{\i1}it belonged to him anymore.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.23,0:16:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It moved upwards of its own accord,{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.84,0:16:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}rising for the third time.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.01,0:16:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Gulp!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.87,0:16:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}As soon as it was fully raised,{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.21,0:16:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Who-is-it, who'd been{\i}\N{\i1}jumping from side to side,{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.54,0:16:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}stopped moving completely, and stared{\i}\N{\i1}at the student through the mirror.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.67,0:16:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It gave a sly grin and said—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.80,0:16:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Five times the loyalty points day"{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.05,0:16:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,"Earn five times the points today!"
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.05,0:16:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,A useful piece of info!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.01,0:16:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Like a spirit straight out\Nof a drugstore flyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.43,0:16:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And so he transformed\Ninto a penny-pinching Who-is-it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.85,0:16:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody knows what\Nhappened to him after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.44,0:17:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But was the person who\Nattended university the next day...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.40,0:17:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,really him, or something else?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.91,0:17:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The end!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.45,0:17:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That went really weird,\Nbut what did you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.87,0:17:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I enjoyed it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.67,0:17:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I can imagine how the story\Nwould've gone without the random words,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.71,0:17:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,and it was a great random word ghost story.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.88,0:17:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.18,0:17:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Raising your hand in front of a mirror\Nis something anyone might do,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.68,0:17:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,so anyone could be Who-is-it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.02,0:17:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.02,0:17:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,For all we know, Takeru himself\Nmight have already become Who-is-it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.90,0:17:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Only joking!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.82,0:17:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.32,0:17:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Takeru?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.82,0:17:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.87,0:17:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Which do you think I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.29,0:17:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-You're the real Takeru, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.04,0:18:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Right! And that's the end of my story!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.26,0:18:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What a relief!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.72,0:18:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That wasn't fair, Hidaka.\NYou said "The end"!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.72,0:18:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I wanted to give you a real fright!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.44,0:18:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, you got us!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.06,0:18:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,But what would you have done\Nif I hadn't said that as a joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.44,0:18:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet you would've said it yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.16,0:18:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Like "So, who do you think I am now?"
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.41,0:18:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I would have. It's embarrassing\Nhow you can see right through me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.48,0:18:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You were really good, Takeru!\NYou got me so scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.42,0:18:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The End{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.27,0:18:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Victim: Sakagami{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.64,0:19:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The victim is Mr. Sakagami.\NHe worked at a stockbroking firm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.98,0:19:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The cause of death is obviously this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.86,0:19:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The knife in his chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.20,0:19:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Estimating the time of death from\Nhis scream that we heard,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.83,0:19:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,it happened only moments ago,\Njust before 12 o'clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.62,0:19:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,So the culprit is most likely\Nstill somewhere in this hotel!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.92,0:19:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kaori, detective, special skill: smiling{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.59,0:19:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}For some reason, crimes often{\i}\N{\i1}happen when she's around.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.59,0:19:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But I thought you said\Nyou were a journalist!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.18,0:19:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretending to be a detective—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.89,0:19:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Takeru, pharmacist, likes: ramen{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.19,0:19:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Here on vacation, he's never met{\i}\N{\i1}these two before.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.65,0:19:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,We should leave this to the police,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.86,0:19:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,and go back to our rooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.15,0:19:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Tomoko, college student,{\i}\N{\i1}special skill: cooking{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.91,0:19:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Here to climb a nearby mountain,{\i}\N{\i1}she's never met these two either.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.83,0:19:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,No way, I've got no signal!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.91,0:20:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Me neither! Must be a dead spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.23,0:20:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.54,0:20:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I know who did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.46,0:20:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.71,0:20:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you still pretending\Nto be a detective?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.71,0:20:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I am a detective.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.34,0:20:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? You are?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.47,0:20:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,A flash of inspiration, and it's solved!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.35,0:20:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,One fact is not enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.10,0:20:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole case is in my head!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.56,0:20:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.44,0:20:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Great Detective Kaori!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.37,0:20:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's not just a costume?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.99,0:20:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,If you really are a detective,\Nthen what have you discovered?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.08,0:20:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Great comeback.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.88,0:20:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,There are no signs of a struggle\Nwhere Mr. Sakagami is lying,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.50,0:20:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,even though he'd be sure to resist\Nbeing stabbed from the front.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.84,0:20:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No struggle, so he was caught by surprise?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.01,0:21:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no evidence,\Nwhich leads to the solution!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.39,0:21:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.10,0:21:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The culprit must be one of the six guests\Nstaying here, including us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.76,0:21:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Me, Tomoko, Takeru,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.03,0:21:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Ms. T the dancer, Mr. Sakagami's colleague Mr. M,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.32,0:21:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,and the self-styled alien U.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.66,0:21:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Some weird people here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.20,0:21:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, the guest list was on display.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.42,0:21:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,And like any ordinary hotel,\Nthe staff are all robots.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.21,0:21:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,No other suspects or witnesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.42,0:21:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly, my dear Watson!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.38,0:21:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You're really into this role!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.55,0:21:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Us three were together when we heard\Nhim scream, so we have alibis.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.35,0:21:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Who did it, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.52,0:21:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Elementary, my dear Watson!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.52,0:21:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Somone who could get close\Nto the victim easily,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.07,0:21:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,and is skilled with weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.07,0:21:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean—
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.20,0:22:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The culprit is his colleague M!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.87,0:22:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The murderer may be close by!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.29,0:22:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We must warn the\Nother guests of the danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.67,0:22:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,First, the woman, Ms. T.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.76,0:22:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Ms. T, sorry, but this is an emergency!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.26,0:22:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,M-Mr. M!

